WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:02.168 align:start size:94% position:6%
-America's three months
into a coronavirus pandemic,

00:00:02.168 --> 00:00:03.603 align:start size:94% position:6%
and at this point
we've all been told

00:00:03.603 --> 00:00:06.406 align:start size:94% position:6%
to wash our hands
about 2 million times.

00:00:06.406 --> 00:00:07.440 align:start size:94% position:6%
But what's the right way
to do it?

00:00:07.440 --> 00:00:10.744 align:start size:94% position:6%
Here to tell us is one of ou
writers, Jenny Hagel.

00:00:10.744 --> 00:00:12.912 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Hey, Seth.
-Hey, Jenny.

00:00:12.912 --> 00:00:17.217 align:start size:94% position:6%
So what is the right way
to wash your hands?

00:00:17.217 --> 00:00:18.084 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-Great question.

00:00:18.084 --> 00:00:20.153 align:start size:94% position:6%
To make sure your hands
are germ-free,

00:00:20.153 --> 00:00:21.354 line:92%
wash them for 20 seconds.

00:00:21.354 --> 00:00:24.024 align:start size:94% position:6%
Make sure you wash the tops of
your hand, to your palms,

00:00:24.024 --> 00:00:26.292 align:start size:94% position:6%
your thumbs, and the tips
of your fingers.

00:00:26.292 --> 00:00:28.795 align:start size:94% position:6%
If you do that
12 to 24 times a day,

00:00:28.795 --> 00:00:31.831 align:start size:94% position:6%
your hands will be
in great shape.

00:00:31.831 --> 00:00:34.134 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Oh, my God!
Jenny.

00:00:34.134 --> 00:00:36.536 align:start size:94% position:6%
-What?
Is something wrong?

00:00:36.536 --> 00:00:40.673 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Jenny, your hands --
they don't look so good.

00:00:40.673 --> 00:00:45.278 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Oh.
Do they look a little dry?

00:00:45.278 --> 00:00:46.546 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-Yes.

00:00:46.546 --> 00:00:48.848 align:start size:94% position:6%
-That's from
all the hand washing.

00:00:48.848 --> 00:00:51.518 align:start size:94% position:6%
But, there's an easy way
to solve that.

00:00:51.518 --> 00:00:52.819 line:92%
Every time you wash your hands

00:00:52.819 --> 00:00:54.487 align:start size:94% position:6%
be sure to moisturize
with lotion.

00:00:54.487 --> 00:00:57.624
Apply a generous amount, and
then just rub it in thoroughly

00:00:57.624 --> 00:01:02.195 align:start size:94% position:6%
And if you do that, your hands
will be silky smooth.

00:01:02.195 --> 00:01:06.166 line:92%
-Jenny, are your hands okay?

00:01:06.166 --> 00:01:06.800 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-They sure are.

00:01:06.800 --> 00:01:10.570
By washing my hands regularly,
I can be sure of three things.

00:01:10.570 --> 00:01:12.672 line:92%
One, I'm keeping myself safe

00:01:12.672 --> 00:01:14.374 line:92%
Two, I'm keeping others safe

00:01:14.374 --> 00:01:18.144 align:start size:94% position:6%
And three, I'm getting
in a habit of good hygiene

00:01:18.144 --> 00:01:19.879 line:92%
It's like the CDC says --

00:01:19.879 --> 00:01:24.451 align:start size:94% position:6%
Ooh, I need my reading glasses
Excuse me.

00:01:27.253 --> 00:01:27.921 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
There we go.

00:01:27.921 --> 00:01:30.857
"When you wash your hands,
you protect your community."

00:01:30.857 --> 00:01:33.526 align:start size:94% position:6%
Well, Seth,
you know who has two thumb

00:01:33.526 --> 00:01:35.862 size:88% position:44% line:92%
and loves her community?

00:01:35.862 --> 00:01:36.896 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
This gal.

00:01:36.896 --> 00:01:39.032 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Jenny, I'm looking closel
at your hands,

00:01:39.032 --> 00:01:41.601 align:start size:94% position:6%
and I can't help but notice...
-I know.

00:01:41.601 --> 00:01:42.702 size:88% position:44% line:92%
It's hard not to notice.

00:01:42.702 --> 00:01:45.538 align:start size:94% position:6%
-I mean, I don't want to b
forward, but --

00:01:45.538 --> 00:01:47.207 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-You can say it.

00:01:47.207 --> 00:01:48.441 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-Can I say it?

00:01:48.441 --> 00:01:51.444 align:start size:94% position:6%
-I'll say it.
I got engaged!

00:01:51.444 --> 00:01:52.245 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
Look at my ring!

00:01:52.245 --> 00:01:55.281
-I mean, congratulations, bu
that's not what I was gonna say.

00:01:55.281 --> 00:01:59.352 align:start size:94% position:6%
-My fiancée and I
are so happy.

00:01:59.352 --> 00:02:01.054 line:92%
-Oh, she washes her hands too.

00:02:01.054 --> 00:02:05.291
-Seth, even in these dark times,
there can still be a little joy.

00:02:05.291 --> 00:02:07.193 line:92%
If we just think to ourselves,

00:02:07.193 --> 00:02:10.196 align:start size:94% position:6%
"What's something I can do
to help the world?

00:02:10.196 --> 00:02:13.433
Is there some small thing
that I can do -- me --

00:02:13.433 --> 00:02:14.767 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
to help everyone?"

00:02:14.767 --> 00:02:17.337 align:start size:94% position:6%
And the answer is,
wash your hands.

00:02:17.337 --> 00:02:19.539 align:start size:94% position:6%
If you're doing that,
let me tell you,

00:02:19.539 --> 00:02:21.207 size:88% position:44% line:92%
you deserve a high-five.

00:02:21.207 --> 00:02:22.242 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Clatters ]

00:02:22.242 --> 00:02:23.810 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
Oh, no, my ring!

00:02:23.810 --> 00:02:26.846 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Jenny Hagel, everybody.
Oh... [mutters]

00:02:26.846 --> 00:02:28.548 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-Bye!

